# Cognis Docker setup reference.
# Runtime defaults are grouped under docker/env/. Select both a database driver
# profile and an environment profile through one of these Compose files:
#   docker-compose.postgres.yaml
#   docker-compose.postgres.dev.yaml
#   docker-compose.mariadb.yaml
#   docker-compose.mariadb.dev.yaml
#
# Review the selected driver-specific production env file before deployment.
# Database URLs, passwords, and the production encryption key are intentionally
# blank and must be supplied with deployment-specific values.
